WEBVTT

00:12:59.063 --> 00:13:00.274
Táto Zem,

00:13:01.144 --> 00:13:02.361
náš domov,

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:06.602
volá, aby sme nabrali odvahu,

00:13:08.142 --> 00:13:11.215
pripomína, že sme v tom všetci spolu:

00:13:11.907 --> 00:13:13.320
ženy, muži,

00:13:13.344 --> 00:13:15.435
ľudia s rôznym pohlavím,

00:13:15.459 --> 00:13:16.681
všetky bytosti.

00:13:17.964 --> 00:13:19.700
Sme životnou silou,

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.148
jednou Zemou,

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:24.363
jednou príležitosťou.

00:13:25.182 --> 00:13:26.628
Chopme sa jej.

00:13:26.652 --> 00:13:28.082
Ďakujem.

00:13:28.106 --> 00:13:32.329
(potlesk)